<title>FINLAND: SUUNTO SEES RISING PROFIT, SALES IN 1997.</title>
<headline>SUUNTO SEES RISING PROFIT, SALES IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish compass maker Suunto Oy said on Thursday it expected profit and sales to improve this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Net sales of the Suunto group will turn into a rise and earnings will improve,&quot; the company said in a statement with its 1996 results.  </p>
<p>Last year, Suunto's net sales were flat at 282.5 million markka while group profit after financial items more than halved to 12.6 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
